_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-db3050aa76788f45END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-bf8765eae4ab79edEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_SteelWatchFoundry_GondianGnomeOrders</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SteelWatchFoundry_GondianGnomeOrders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SteelWatchFoundry_GondianGnomeOrders\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">1a885a25-c403-4bde-a4e5-e0824db02248</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1a885a25-c403-4bde-a4e5-e0824db02248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1a885a25-c403-4bde-a4e5-e0824db02248\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a stack of scrolls in the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-334&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-147</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Banite Confidential. Though it's important to cooperate with our siblings who worship <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul\" title=\"Myrkul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/20px-Myrkul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/30px-Myrkul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/40px-Myrkul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Myrkul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/20px-Myrkul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul\" title=\"Myrkul\">Myrkul</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/29px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/39px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>, remember that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/13px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/19px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/26px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/13px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\">Bane</a> is the Tyrant, it is Bane who rules. Subversion and capture of <a href=\"/wiki/Gond\" title=\"Gond\">Gondian</a> operations in Baldur's Gate is a Banite project, particularly as regards the <a href=\"/wiki/Gondian\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondian\">gnomish</a> artificers. They are ours - or, more particularly, MINE. They are not to be tadpoled, as that would expose them to control through the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a> hierarchy. Instead, they are to be locked in Incineration <a href=\"/wiki/Kill_Collar\" title=\"Kill Collar\">Collars</a> that are remote controlled by <a href=\"/wiki/Waldemar_Prinski\" title=\"Waldemar Prinski\">Prinski's</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Motivator\" title=\"Motivator\">Motivators</a>. I want those gnomes aware of what they are doing and deeply unhappy about it. When the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Watcher Project</a> is complete and the artificers are of no further use, the survivors will then be tadpoled.\n</p><p><br>\n-  Lord Gortash\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2403/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40078/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13045/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 6/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 979914/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.324      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.324      1 -total\n 57.72%   26.738     10 Template:Icon_text\n 49.87%   23.100     23 Template:Trim\n 20.77%    9.623      5 Template:Icon_link\n 19.92%    9.226      2 Template:Uid\n 13.75%    6.368      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.07%    6.054      4 Template:Deity\n 11.71%    5.423      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.24%    4.743     10 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30793-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215723 and revision id 365787. Rendering was triggered because: diff-page\n -->\n</div>"}